{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve inclusion when descending into a selected container.** In `EXCLUDE_ALL` mode, selecting `PreviewField.path(\"customer\")` marks the object visible here but recursion re-evaluates every child as excluded-by-default, so the selected field silently produces no preview. Carry an inherited-inclusion flag while still applying nested exclude/mask rules, and cover selected objects and object arrays in tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ocNnw","finding_digest":"267f1d7b17736fa6c20749277342994991d81a3c9c8cd79fad70729db5683ab2","finding_id":"arf_v1_ez7r26yxonx2nqqhjetxgquzjg","finding_key":"sdk/serde/serdespreview::collect::included-container-visibility","identity_key":"sdk/serde/serdespreview::collect::included-container-visibility","line":121,"observation_digest":"b0fb54d2980374a10c6c6a17a97468962658715ee7744c98fdbff9284c628103","observation_id":"aro_v1_wd5vjuuyan2kcddmnil2s5disy","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T00:39:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_khswv4gqnsthbvxta7ni53jxgu","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"3d72acd7d2a28b441036e7109c6bd408f741325b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":120,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_rx4u6lwm6uitequmgrr4r2algx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T00:39:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
